{"manifest":"{\"format\":1,\"version\":\"5.0.11\",\"notes\":\"5.0.11 — HOTFIX (Kovan beta 0.1.5 kaldı): League Asistanı'nda oyuncu arama artık sekme değil, her sekmede en üstte duran bir arama çubuğu (Arkadaşlarım listesiyle). Karşı seçim sekmesi tam genişlik, rol/rakip/şampiyon havuzu bölümleri ferah ve düzenli.\",\"minLoader\":1,\"created\":\"2026-11-06T21:25:16.110Z\",\"files\":{\"StatScan.html\":{\"sha256\":\"3c9846015dec61a03ff5722365e9adaace1c42e3b07d66bded287c342513deea\",\"size\":1421305},\"desktop/app.js\":{\"sha256\":\"53dbdbb7ea410ef4efc8bdd6f6ba3f5343ef85708771128b48afb74756468c51\",\"size\":12999},\"desktop/assets/icon.ico\":{\"sha256\":\"b0d623d0b828bcf7603ee02ac7b5cc8e9b27b13fdb5c3eff548f2cb7b7963543\",\"size\":372526},\"desktop/assets/icon.png\":{\"sha256\":\"6ce7c330fdcf2d8785ba7ea16895cc376bfbb22b4ee061da7a0692002c3ca376\",\"size\":99730},\"desktop/host.js\":{\"sha256\":\"0e1ee75243651db9e720b0a0dcd5f11fb3d130a0150565e246aeee2f4ad225e0\",\"size\":331537},\"desktop/preload.js\":{\"sha256\":\"167da41ad183f6cb33a075644d2ddcc20b4838ed68b99f4d2927f5cdf324db43\",\"size\":8785},\"dyn/collector.ps1\":{\"sha256\":\"3329b8cdf5257002b1f0fbe10bbc0da8ed09103d33ff67618ab8d897a61b71cb\",\"size\":39356},\"dyn/README-dinamik.md\":{\"sha256\":\"da91e62f58ce365cdec59c1ec4b689c8cf0412e742c1ea728d8ba09394485b0d\",\"size\":7201},\"dyn/statscan-dyn.js\":{\"sha256\":\"bfc3f746e061f22ae93f36968e0952f2162470b39534a2d3f8c6489795b0f883\",\"size\":115235}}}","sig":"yd3znaJ7glsrXraXaJHkPhzO9/TDvCJhVhuZHcureTgXAIFIy8KzmGoshwHl808BZH+dI8N02a4oWyXHniT/CQ==","data":{"StatScan.html":"","desktop/app.js":"","desktop/assets/icon.ico":"","desktop/assets/icon.png":"","desktop/host.js":"","desktop/preload.js":"","dyn/collector.ps1":"","dyn/README-dinamik.md":"","dyn/statscan-dyn.js":""}}